; D1 write corpus (synthetic data, S0020).
option "title" "implicit_prices plugin"
option "operating_currency" "USD"
plugin "beancount.plugins.implicit_prices"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking USD
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash USD
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Food USD
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Coffee USD
2020-01-01 open Income:Salary USD
2020-01-01 open Equity:Opening USD
2020-01-01 open Assets:Broker:Fund FUND
2020-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Euro EUR
2024-01-05 * "Broker" "buy"
  Assets:Broker:Fund  2 FUND {5.00 USD}
  Assets:Bank:Checking  -10.00 USD
2024-01-06 * "Exchange" "currency"
  Assets:Bank:Euro  100.00 EUR @ 1.10 USD
  Assets:Bank:Checking  -110.00 USD
